{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"w":0.21604937235514321,"h":0.016022611984234936,"y":0.10029069793250378,"x":0.65226337956316915,"c":1,"t":"Sample Writing answers"},{"y":0.14534883701951962,"w":0.33539095560709636,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 1","x":0.086419748424021059,"h":0.020434436865493177,"c":1},{"w":0.64814814249674479,"h":0.016008916255020877,"c":1,"y":0.18021201411819743,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.5 score.","x":0.088477368974082732},{"x":0.086339625455241278,"t":"The given scheme explains the process of instant noodles production. Moreover it reveals how","h":0.021279868585341699,"y":0.20415543725028018,"w":0.73473312377929678,"c":1},{"w":0.76543207804361979,"t":"this product appears on super market shelves. In general, there are eight stages of manutacturing","x":0.086419763344776093,"y":0.22526501737745308,"h":0.018921028739291246,"c":1},{"y":0.24411071898238346,"c":1,"t":"before the final product is being delivered to the store.","w":0.43621398925781252,"h":0.018970675968309481,"x":0.086419754210599914},{"h":0.020609852281981533,"y":0.26981520877256115,"t":"The first operation consists of putting flour into storage silos. Then the flour is mixed with some","x":0.086347921013068193,"c":1,"w":0.75323369344075519},{"x":0.088411136090748244,"w":0.75732859293619792,"c":1,"t":"other ingredients into dough in a special machine. The substance is further stretched into sheets","y":0.28900512740780271,"h":0.021080154131382756},{"w":0.77382029215494785,"c":1,"t":"which a cut into thin strips during the fourth stage. The following operation involves the strips too.","x":0.088389362843023872,"y":0.30847195006938488,"h":0.021331355765514592},{"x":0.088477374679385434,"c":1,"h":0.018979236571331048,"t":"At this moment the noodles are formed into discs. Affer that the round-shaped figures are cooked","w":0.77777776082356775,"y":0.32848837248113472},{"x":0.086419752029691779,"t":"in oil and dried. The seventh stage consists of placing the product into cups and adding some","w":0.73662551879882809,"h":0.018929588219021465,"y":0.34738372127913442,"c":1},{"x":0.086366074209136723,"h":0.020429512356419988,"c":1,"y":0.36626209424145184,"w":0.76349411010742196,"t":"vegetables and spices to it. The final part of production process is mainly about the packaging. At"},{"x":0.086358515684458528,"y":0.38580538816984622,"t":"this moment freshly printed lables are added to the cups which are sealed after that. As soon as","w":0.75939748128255213,"h":0.020243457124707875,"c":1},{"x":0.088477356859773218,"t":"the product (instant noodles) is ready to leave the factory, it is shipped to a shopping facility.","y":0.40547703163899829,"w":0.72839508056640623,"h":0.018941572613935143,"c":1},{"h":0.018895348053517669,"c":1,"t":"Overall, it takes a considerably long time for a product to get to a super market.","x":0.088477370902918392,"y":0.43313953527117244,"w":0.63580245971679694},{"y":0.46790341567411031,"w":0.29423868815104165,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.088477363639793694,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"h":0.015988372380376759,"x":0.13168724437641866,"y":0.49999999985099386,"w":0.71193415323893228,"t":"This response addresses the task fully and provides a description for each stage","c":1},{"y":0.5158018104982055,"h":0.019405931129051202,"t":"of the process, along with supporting details. A stronger overview would help to","w":0.69971399943033852,"x":0.13163177878464333,"c":1},{"x":0.12962963832084673,"t":"raise the overall score. Information is logically organised and the reader is guided","y":0.53343023241211152,"w":0.72016459147135414,"h":0.016039732066986834,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"through the answer by a range of cohesive devices [Moreover | In general | The first","x":0.13162696010662378,"w":0.74293426513671867,"h":0.01842673507259085,"y":0.54895010576745973},{"c":1,"y":0.5656560421343132,"t":"operation | Then | further | too | At this moment | After that | The seventh stage | The","x":0.13159794672178596,"w":0.7347498575846354,"h":0.018830843050432144},{"c":1,"y":0.58421672558329441,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"final part | Overal[]. There is also use of reference [this] and substitution [product]","x":0.13168723516026878,"w":0.71604939778645826},{"c":1,"w":0.7141372172037761,"x":0.13161430963505988,"y":0.59946477725069403,"t":"to add variety to the description. There is some flexibility in the use of vocabulary","h":0.017582585589764999},{"h":0.017915780749281685,"y":0.6162527577929644,"t":"[Labelling + sealing → lables \/ labels are added to the cups which are sealed] and","x":0.13161455875126099,"w":0.72236979166666671,"c":1},{"w":0.71399175008138016,"y":0.63368669047931303,"h":0.016022611984234936,"c":1,"t":"there is good use of less common items [The substance | round-shaped figures |","x":0.13168725257909236},{"x":0.13168724050821634,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"w":0.73662551879882809,"t":"the product | packaging]. There is a variety of complex structures used and most of","y":0.64958775025257964},{"h":0.016005492463128657,"x":0.1316872365324977,"c":1,"w":0.65226338704427089,"y":0.66715116264150753,"t":"these are accurate: there is an error in line 6 [which a cut \/ which are cut]."},{"y":0.92005813935192304,"x":0.83950617327863897,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"133"}]}